  "artwork": "Real fixture CAD, accepted faucet lever and thimble; the complete factory screw clamps use nominal catalogue-form proxies and fasteners use size proxies. The installed faucet lever is omitted from nominal jig views because its accepted pose has no measured CAD transform.",
  "physical_scope": "Observations establish the faucet assembly sequence. The identified \u00d87.75 mm liner trial failed to grip at rigid closure. The centred grip with proud liners has no physical grip acceptance; nominal geometry and offline slices do not establish insertion force, grip, seating, equal load sharing, fixture strength or endurance. Supplier clamp specifications do not rate the complete assembly.",
